1
00:00:00,259 --> 00:00:04,629
(Amy:)Yeah, yeah, you want a cigarette.
Well, I'd like a normal boyfriend. Deal with it.

2
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:08,696
Oh. Hey, what's up?

3
00:00:08,868 --> 00:00:11,068
(Penny:)Um...

4
00:00:12,238 --> 00:00:15,268
(Penny:)You need me to shut the door
so you can do your knocking thing?

5
00:00:17,076 --> 00:00:19,136
(Sheldon:)No. I didn't start yet. It's fine.

6
00:00:19,345 --> 00:00:21,275
(Penny:)Okay. So, what do you need?

7
00:00:21,447 --> 00:00:26,147
(Sheldon:)Well, I was thinking about
you helping me out last night.

8
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:27,952
(Sheldon:)Penny.

9
00:00:30,122 --> 00:00:34,082
And I just wanted to tell you, Penny...

10
00:00:35,661 --> 00:00:40,261
(Sheldon:)...that the answer to the question,
"Who did a great job?" is you.

11
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:43,097
(Sheldon:)Penny.

12
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,000
- Really?
- Yes.

13
00:00:46,172 --> 00:00:48,432
(Sheldon:)You were very natural
in front of the camera...

14
00:00:48,608 --> 00:00:50,978
(Sheldon:)...and I found your suggestions
extremely helpful.

15
00:00:51,644 --> 00:00:54,014
Oh, sweetie, you just made my day.

16
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,510
(Leonard:)Okay.

17
00:00:57,183 --> 00:01:01,453
(Penny:)My acting class is putting on a play Friday.
I can put you and Amy on the guest list.

